msgid "To run Spyder when installed standalone, you can simply use your operating system's typical method of launching applications, such as opening it from the :guilabel:`Start` menu on Windows (or the Taskbar, if you've pinned it there), from Launchpad, Spotlight or the :guilabel:`Applications` folder on macOS (or the Dock, if you've added it there), or your preferred application launcher on Linux."
